dhcp: Report pending updates in agent state

The DHCP agent logs the length of its update queue, but only at debug
level. Report it as pending_updates in the configurations the agent
sends with every heartbeat, as the L3 agent does.

Related-Bug: #2170465
Prompt: after proposing pending_updates for the L3 agent, Mikal asked for
the equivalent DHCP agent change as a second patch in the same series;
the DHCP agent uses the same ResourceProcessingQueue.
